{"title":"七律·雷电","alias":"","parts":[{"type":"title","text":"七律·雷电＊"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"积云忽作闷雷声，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨弹光刀欲杀人。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岂向瑶台追幻梦，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"还从烈火识真金。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"几枝玉叶化灰蝶，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"再度铁梅成赤心。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稳似泰山同携手，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陶然一笑友情深。"}],"authors":["毛泽东"],"dates":[],"is_range_date":false,"comments":[],"comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":217,"page_end":217}